Table~\ref{tab:task2} scores the most-probable-seam task: whether the named seam received a prediction, and the matched path error. Two methods sit at $100\%$ selection for a reason that is not skill (\M5 receives one mask per seam instance, \M6 transfers every seam from the model); their localisation is the number to read. \M7 localises the named seam within $\taskTwoQuadricRmseMax\mm$ on every class.

